WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:11.564
Cora and Wanda shot away from the net.

2
00:00:11.565 --> 00:00:15.165
"That was close!" Cora said.

3
00:00:15.166 --> 00:00:18.189
"Where's Mo?" Wanda asked.

4
00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:23.196
Cora gasped. "He got caught in the net!"

5
00:00:23.197 --> 00:00:28.591
Cora and Wanda raced back to the net.

6
00:00:28.592 --> 00:00:31.411
"Help!" Mo cried.

7
00:00:31.412 --> 00:00:34.995
The net was going up toward the surface.

8
00:00:34.996 --> 00:00:41.318
"Hold on, Mo!" Cora said. "I'll free you!"

9
00:00:41.319 --> 00:00:45.762
Cora used her beak to cut the net open.

10
00:00:45.763 --> 00:00:55.998
Mo swam out. "Phew!"

11
00:00:55.999 --> 00:00:59.332
Then he whispered something.

12
00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:05.171
"Maybe Wanda's mom got caught."

13
00:01:05.172 --> 00:01:09.785
"Whales are too big for those nets," Cora said.

14
00:01:09.786 --> 00:01:14.037
"But I have an idea!"

15
00:01:14.038 --> 00:01:16.317
Cora swam back to Wanda.

16
00:01:16.318 --> 00:01:20.562
"Could a whale call help find your mom?"

17
00:01:20.563 --> 00:01:24.911
"Yes," Wanda said. "But . . ."

18
00:01:24.912 --> 00:01:29.463
She looked worried. "Mama won't hear my call.

19
00:01:29.464 --> 00:01:34.698
The boats are too noisy!"

20
00:01:34.699 --> 00:01:40.338
"Just give it a try," Cora said.

21
00:01:40.339 --> 00:01:50.938
Wanda called to Mama.

22
00:01:50.939 --> 00:01:54.544
"It's not working!" Wanda said.

23
00:01:54.545 --> 00:01:57.250
"The boats are too noisy."

24
00:01:57.251 --> 00:02:00.583
Wanda started to cry.

25
00:02:00.584 --> 00:02:03.856
Cora gulped.

26
00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:07.611
"The arrow is lost," she thought.

27
00:02:07.612 --> 00:02:10.594
"And so is Wanda's mom.

28
00:02:10.595 --> 00:02:14.883
What are we going to do?"

